From: Yeye B.B.C. <19569343+yeyebbc@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] dt-bindings: phy: qcom: Describe SM8750 UFS reference supplies

Some SM8750 boards power the QMP reference circuitry with separate QREF
and REFGEN regulators. Describe the optional inputs for that PHY.

Signed-off-by: Yeye B.B.C. <19569343+yeyebbc@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml         | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml
index 4efe40c0dc97418796b55964c528c2b0799cd64f..553fda52672795accf8b99211b0c8941d51f1d60 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml
@@ -86,6 +86,12 @@ properties:
 
   vdda-pll-supply: true
 
+  vdda-qref-supply:
+    description: Analog supply for the UFS QMP reference-clock circuit
+
+  vdda-refgen-supply:
+    description: Analog supply for the UFS QMP reference generator
+
   "#clock-cells":
     const: 1
 
@@ -172,6 +178,17 @@ allOf:
       required:
         - power-domains
 
+  - if:
+      not:
+        properties:
+          compatible:
+            contains:
+              const: qcom,sm8750-qmp-ufs-phy
+    then:
+      properties:
+        vdda-qref-supply: false
+        vdda-refgen-supply: false
+
 additionalProperties: false
 
 examples:
